WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.034
One thousand one hundred and five confirmed records.

00:00:03.034 --> 00:00:11.204
Ethics violations, criminal charges, and documented scandals involving Canadian public officials — compiled into a single searchable database.

00:00:11.204 --> 00:00:14.681
This is the accountability ledger the government never wanted you to see.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:21.624
The Phoenix pay system cost taxpayers over five billion dollars — to pay two hundred and ninety thousand federal employees.

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:26.238
Shopify processes billions in transactions globally for a fraction of that cost.

00:00:26.238 --> 00:00:31.738
ArriveCAN — a COVID questionnaire app — cost fifty-nine point five million dollars.

00:00:31.738 --> 00:00:36.193
Seventy-six percent of subcontractors performed zero documented work.

00:00:36.193 --> 00:00:45.738
The long gun registry cost six hundred and twenty-nine million dollars for what amounts to a database table with four columns: name, address, serial number, and type.

00:00:45.738 --> 00:00:54.818
A deer culling program on a British Columbia island cost eight hundred thousand dollars — nine thousand five hundred and twenty-four dollars per deer — using helicopters.

00:00:54.818 --> 00:01:00.147
Parks Canada spent ten thousand dollars over four years to capture a single bullfrog.

00:01:00.147 --> 00:01:05.193
A fence at Signal Hill cost sixty-five thousand dollars and stood for seven days.

00:01:05.193 --> 00:01:08.284
A barn at Rideau Hall cost eight million dollars.

00:01:08.284 --> 00:01:09.686
These are not errors.

00:01:09.686 --> 00:01:10.693
This is a pattern.
